34823Z', 'done': True, 'done_reason': 'stop', 'total_duration': 23281978339, 'load_duration': 179264470, 'prompt_eval_count': 865, 'prompt_eval_duration': 565373155, 'eval_count': 2202, 'eval_duration': 22536338168, 'model_name': 'gpt-oss:20b'} id='run--5601598f-f0d4-48b5-8d35-bc478f653732-0' usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 865, 'output_tokens': 2202, 'total_tokens': 3067}
